{
  "title": "Ties — ZZ Brakka",
  "html": "<div class=\"pentaryn-ties\" data-actor-id=\"zzNpc00000000001\">\n    \n    <ul class=\"pt-list\"><li class=\"pt-row\" data-id=\"zzPc000000000001\">\n    <div class=\"pt-summary\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"false\"\n      data-action=\"toggle\" data-tooltip=\"Click to open and edit this tie\"\n      aria-label=\"ZZ Caven — open and edit this tie\">\n    <img class=\"pt-portrait\" src=\"icons/zz/zzPc000000000001.webp\" alt=\"\" />\n    <span class=\"pt-who\"><span class=\"pt-name\">ZZ Caven</span><span class=\"pt-note-preview\">Their side.</span><span class=\"pt-reply\" data-tooltip=\"ZZ Caven has written you down too — you are their “debtor”\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-reply\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"pt-reply-word\">debtor</span><span class=\"pt-dot pt-wary\"></span></span></span>\n    <span class=\"pt-word pt-friendly\">mark</span>\n    <span class=\"pt-chip\" data-tooltip=\"Friendly\"><span class=\"pt-dot pt-friendly\"></span><span class=\"pt-chip-label\">Friendly</span></span>\n    <span class=\"pt-pips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Strength 2 of 5 — orders this list\" data-tooltip=\"Strength 2 of 5 — orders this list\"><span class=\"pt-pip fill\"></span><span class=\"pt-pip fill\"></span><span class=\"pt-pip\"></span><span class=\"pt-pip\"></span><span class=\"pt-pip\"></span></span>\n    <span class=\"pt-hint\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-pen\"></i></span>\n  </div>\n    <div class=\"pt-detail-wrap\" hidden><div class=\"pt-detail\">\n    <div class=\"pt-fields\">\n      <label class=\"pt-field\">\n        <span class=\"pt-field-label\">One word — what this character is to ZZ Caven</span>\n        <input type=\"text\" class=\"pt-word-input\" data-field=\"word\" value=\"mark\"\n               placeholder=\"one word — sister, rival, client…\" />\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"pt-field\">\n        <span class=\"pt-field-label\">Stance</span>\n        <select class=\"pt-stance\" data-field=\"stance\"><option value=\"2\">Devoted</option><option value=\"1\" selected>Friendly</option><option value=\"0\">Neutral</option><option value=\"-1\">Wary</option><option value=\"-2\">Hostile</option></select>\n      </label>\n      <span class=\"pt-field\">\n        <span class=\"pt-field-label\">Strength</span>\n        <span class=\"pt-pips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Strength 2 of 5 — orders this list\" data-tooltip=\"Strength 2 of 5 — orders this list\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pt-pip fill\" data-action=\"strength\" data-n=\"1\"\n          aria-label=\"Set strength to 1 of 5\" data-tooltip=\"Set strength to 1 of 5\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pt-pip fill\" data-action=\"strength\" data-n=\"2\"\n          aria-label=\"Set strength to 2 of 5\" data-tooltip=\"Set strength to 2 of 5\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pt-pip\" data-action=\"strength\" data-n=\"3\"\n          aria-label=\"Set strength to 3 of 5\" data-tooltip=\"Set strength to 3 of 5\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pt-pip\" data-action=\"strength\" data-n=\"4\"\n          aria-label=\"Set strength to 4 of 5\" data-tooltip=\"Set strength to 4 of 5\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pt-pip\" data-action=\"strength\" data-n=\"5\"\n          aria-label=\"Set strength to 5 of 5\" data-tooltip=\"Set strength to 5 of 5\"></button></span>\n      </span>\n    </div>\n    <label class=\"pt-field pt-field-notes\">\n      <span class=\"pt-field-label\">Notes — yours, on your side of this tie</span>\n      <textarea class=\"pt-notes-text\" data-field=\"notes\" rows=\"5\" maxlength=\"4000\"\n                placeholder=\"The long version — how they met, what is owed, what is not said in front of ZZ Caven. Only ever visible here.\">Their side.</textarea>\n    </label>\n    <div class=\"pt-detail-actions\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"pt-textbtn\" data-action=\"open\" data-id=\"zzPc000000000001\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square\"></i> Open their sheet\n      </button>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"pt-textbtn pt-del\" data-action=\"remove\" data-id=\"zzPc000000000001\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-trash\"></i> Remove this tie\n      </button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pt-their-side\">\n    <div class=\"pt-their-head\">\n      <span class=\"pt-their-title\">ZZ Caven&#39;s side — what you are to them</span>\n      <span class=\"pt-gm-badge\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-eye-slash\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> GM only</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pt-their-line\"><span class=\"pt-word\">debtor</span><span class=\"pt-chip\" data-tooltip=\"Wary\"><span class=\"pt-dot pt-wary\"></span><span class=\"pt-chip-label\">Wary</span></span><span class=\"pt-pips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Strength 4 of 5 — orders this list\" data-tooltip=\"Strength 4 of 5 — orders this list\"><span class=\"pt-pip fill\"></span><span class=\"pt-pip fill\"></span><span class=\"pt-pip fill\"></span><span class=\"pt-pip fill\"></span><span class=\"pt-pip\"></span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"pt-notes-prose\">Owes.</div>\n    <div class=\"pt-detail-actions\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"pt-textbtn\" data-action=\"edit-theirs\" data-id=\"zzPc000000000001\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-pen\"></i> Edit ZZ Caven&#39;s side\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  </div></div>\n  </li></ul>\n    \n    <div class=\"pt-add-bar\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"pt-add-btn\" data-action=\"add\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-plus\"></i> Add\n        </button>\n        <span class=\"pt-add-hint\">or hover someone on the map and press 6</span>\n      </div>\n    \n    <section class=\"pt-authoring\">\n    <div class=\"pt-inbound-head\">\n      <span class=\"pt-inbound-title\">Authoring</span>\n      <span class=\"pt-gm-badge\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-eye-slash\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> GM only</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pt-kind-picker\">\n    <label class=\"pt-field\">\n      <span class=\"pt-field-label\">Kind</span>\n      <select data-action=\"set-kind\">\n        <option value=\"\">ZZ Brakka is its own kind</option>\n        <optgroup label=\"Used as a kind already\"><option value=\"zzKind0000000001\" selected>ZZ Ghoul</option></optgroup>\n        \n      </select>\n    </label>\n    <p class=\"pt-hint\">Studying this creature writes to the ZZ Ghoul page — the one every ZZ Ghoul shares.</p>\n  </div>\n    <section class=\"pt-lore-editor\" data-lore-key=\"lore:zzNpc00000000001\">\n    <div class=\"pt-group-head\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n      <span class=\"pt-group-title\">What a check can reveal</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"pt-hint pt-lore-warning\">Everything you write here reaches every client. Nothing goes in a row that would ruin the game if read with devtools.</p>\n    <ul class=\"pt-list pt-lore-list\"><li class=\"pt-row pt-lore-row\" data-id=\"l1\">\n            <div class=\"pt-summary pt-lore-summary\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"\n       aria-label=\"Debts, Insight DC 12\">\n    <span class=\"pt-lore-dc\" data-tooltip=\"Insight DC 12\">12</span>\n    <span class=\"pt-lore-label\">Debts</span>\n    <span class=\"pt-lore-skill\">Insight</span>\n    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-down pt-caret\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n  </div>\n            <div class=\"pt-detail-wrap\" hidden><div class=\"pt-detail pt-lore-detail\">\n    <label class=\"pt-field\">\n      <span class=\"pt-field-label\">What they are trying to find out</span>\n      <input type=\"text\" data-field=\"label\" maxlength=\"120\"\n             value=\"Debts\" placeholder=\"Why they left the coast\">\n    </label>\n    <div class=\"pt-fields pt-lore-price\">\n      <label class=\"pt-field\">\n        <span class=\"pt-field-label\">Skill</span>\n        <select data-field=\"skill\"><option value=\"his\">History</option><option value=\"arc\">Arcana</option><option value=\"ins\" selected>Insight</option><option value=\"rel\">Religion</option><option value=\"nat\">Nature</option><option value=\"med\">Medicine</option><option value=\"inv\">Investigation</option></select>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"pt-field pt-field-dc\">\n        <span class=\"pt-field-label\">DC</span>\n        <input type=\"number\" data-field=\"dc\" min=\"1\" max=\"40\" value=\"12\">\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"pt-field\">\n        <span class=\"pt-field-label\">Approval</span>\n        <select data-field=\"hold\" data-tooltip=\"Hold the result until you deliver it, so you can play the moment out first.\"><option value=\"\" selected>Use the world default</option><option value=\"on\">Always hold</option><option value=\"off\">Never hold</option></select>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n    <label class=\"pt-field pt-field-notes\">\n      <span class=\"pt-field-label\">What a pass tells them</span>\n      <textarea data-field=\"text\" rows=\"4\" maxlength=\"4000\"\n                placeholder=\"The thing they learn if they make the DC.\">&lt;p&gt;He owes the guild.&lt;/p&gt;</textarea>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"pt-field pt-field-notes\">\n      <span class=\"pt-field-label\">On a failure (shown to the player — leave empty to show nothing)</span>\n      <textarea data-field=\"miss\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"4000\"\n                placeholder=\"What they take away from a failed check — a partial or misleading impression. Leave empty and a failure shows them nothing.\">&lt;p&gt;Shifty.&lt;/p&gt;</textarea>\n      <span class=\"pt-hint\">Shown to the player exactly like a pass, so it must not say it was a failure. Empty means a failure shows nothing. Either way the failure is recorded and they cannot retry.</span>\n    </label>\n    <div class=\"pt-detail-actions\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"pt-textbtn pt-del\" data-action=\"lore-remove\" data-id=\"l1\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-trash\"></i> Delete this row\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div></div>\n          </li></ul>\n    <div class=\"pt-add-bar\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"pt-add-btn\" data-action=\"lore-add\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-plus\"></i> Add a fact\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n    <div class=\"pt-group-head\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\">\n      <span class=\"pt-group-title\">What they believe</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"pt-hint\">Exactly what each character was told, kept so you do not have to remember it mid-scene. Held rolls wait here until you deliver them.</p>\n    <ul class=\"pt-list pt-belief-list\"><li class=\"pt-belief\"\n      data-character=\"zzPc000000000001\" data-ns=\"attr\" data-fact=\"#id\">\n    <div class=\"pt-belief-head\">\n      <span class=\"pt-belief-who\">ZZ Caven</span>\n      <span class=\"pt-belief-fact\">#id</span>\n      <span class=\"pt-belief-meta\">rolled 15</span>\n      \n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pt-belief-text\" data-enrich=\"&lt;p&gt;From Vel.&lt;/p&gt;\"></div>\n    <div class=\"pt-belief-actions\">\n      <span class=\"pt-belief-when\">Delivered 11/14/2023, 10:13:20 PM</span>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"pt-textbtn\" data-action=\"belief-reset\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-rotate-left\"></i> Let them roll again\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </li></ul>\n  </section>\n  </div>"
}
